    "b6f4bc34-e3af-4621-8266-45cb00992b11": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14869665153105__b6f4bc34-e3af-4621-8266-45cb00992b11-1687383196f5540d12-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "IMMUNE + DETOX SUPPORT",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--14869665153105__b6f4bc34-e3af-4621-8266-45cb00992b11-1687383196f5540d12-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The immune system doesn't struggle in isolation. Environmental toxins, hormonal burden, and the body's daily accumulation of metabolic waste all place demands on immune function before anything else comes along. Supporting immunity means addressing what undermines it, not just fueling the defenses.<\/p><p>Orenda Immune + Detox® is the hero of this collection, an immune formula that combines plasmacytoid dendritic cell support through IMMUSE® LC-Plasma postbiotic with dedicated daily detoxification support through calcium d-glucarate and glucuronidation.* Two decades of clinical conviction in two capsules daily.<\/p><p>Orenda Clean® approaches the same picture from a different angle: a daily detox drink that supports natural cleansing, liver support, and digestive comfort with 18 ingredients, including serrapeptase, milk thistle, ashwagandha, and aronia berry.*<\/p><p>The Awaken Bundle brings Orenda Immune + Detox® and O-Tropin® together because the neuroendocrine system and the immune system are more closely connected than most approaches acknowledge. When recovery improves, immune function improves with it.*<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        },
